WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:05,110
Machinery factory? That’s a fat job.

2
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,910
How did he get it? Isn't it a steel broken sword?

3
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:12,940
Quiet! It’s time to go to work, stop being around

4
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,967
sunny day

5
00:00:14,967 --> 00:00:21,050
Paid the family's money

6
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:24,050
The money, tickets, and three big bucks in dad's cabinet are all gone.

7
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,850
You entered the factory as soon as you broke the steel. You must have stolen money and gained connections.

8
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,050
Second brother, how could you steal family money?

9
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,850
That's the money you give to your eldest brother to find a wife.

10
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:37,970
I have nothing to do with you anymore

11
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:41,850
If you dare to slander again, don’t blame me for being rude.

12
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:45,450
Are you still pretending? You didn’t steal it. Where did you get your job?

13
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:47,850
That’s it, second brother, admit it

14
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:52,780
First, the divorce document is written in black and white

15
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,580
Second, say I stole money, get evidence

16
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:58,980
Third, when I entered the machinery factory, I relied on my own ability.

17
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:00,980
It has nothing to do with your family
